  "description": "⭐ Become a bootlegger at <strong>Moonshine Saloon</strong> and enjoy delicious cocktails crafted from your smuggled liquor as part of Clyde Cassidy’s bootlegging empire.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<em>🎉 Celebrating a special occasion? Assign a character to the star of your party and watch them play out the story! 🎉</em><br>\r\n<em>👉 For personalised packages, private sessions, or full buyouts, please visit our </em><a href=\"https://moonshinesaloon.com/london/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><em>website</em></a><br>\r\n<em>👉 For special occasion bookings of 12+ people for unlisted dates, please get in touch via the email address in the ‘Regarding Tickets’ section of the&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://moonshinesaloon.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><em>FAQs</em></a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Tickets for Moonshine Saloon: Immersive Wild West Cocktail Experience in London</strong><br>\r\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Rookie Ticket</strong>&nbsp;- includes entry for 1 to the Moonshine Saloon<br>\r\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Bandit Ticket</strong>&nbsp;- includes entry for 1 to the Moonshine Saloon + a bonus additional cocktail from the secret Moonshine distillery<br>\r\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Outlaw Ticket</strong>&nbsp;- includes entry for 1 to the Moonshine Saloon + a bonus additional cocktail from the secret Moonshine distillery + Sweets from the local confectionery + Take-home branded playing card &amp; dice set.<br>\r\n🎫&nbsp;<strong>Become a Character Add-On</strong>&nbsp;(entry not included) - choose between 3 characters unique to you or someone in your group, and get your own special costume:&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>The Deputy Sheriff - Cassidy’s informant inside the law</li>\r\n\t<li>The Brothel Keeper - Sells law enforcers’ secrets to Cassidy for cash</li>\r\n\t<li>The Mayor - A secret player in Cassidy’s bootlegging business&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🏜️ Step into an immersive Wild West experience in East London<br>\r\n🍹 Enjoy 3-4 bespoke cocktails crafted from your smuggled bottle of liquor<br>\r\n🤝 Interact with live actors<br>\r\n🤠 Deal cards and roll the dice with fellow outlaws for some good old-fashioned entertainment<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 45 minutes<br>\r\n📍 Location: Moonshine Saloon, 28-30 Houndsditch, London, EC3A 7DB<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this experience is fully accessible<br>\r\n👗 Dress code: you’ll be given Western clothes to fit right in and avoid the Sheriff’s prying eyes<br>\r\n🍸 Please note: BYOB alcohol (all liqueurs, bitters, syrups and mixers to make high-quality cocktails will be provided)<br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://moonshinesaloon.com/liverpool/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n🎁 Click <a href=\"https://moonshinesaloon-london.giftpro.co.uk/vouchers/immersive-experience-with-cocktails-for-two/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here </a>to get gift card tickets to Moonshine Saloon for your loved ones.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nFrom the creators of <em>Alcotraz</em> and <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/118999\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Avora</em></a> comes another incredible interactive cocktail experience.&nbsp;Step into London’s hidden underworld at Moonshine Saloon, where you’ll mingle with locals, play games, and sip on custom cocktails expertly crafted from your smuggled liquor. Dressed in a Western wardrobe provided by the town’s tailor, you’ll be sure to fit right in. Watch out for the Sheriff, though, if they happen to pass through town… one wrong word is all it takes to bring down Cassidy’s empire! If you prove you can be trusted, you’ll also be treated to a close-up tour of Cassidy’s infamous Moonshine Distillery. Sounds 